<description>&lt;p&gt;Construction vehicles were torched in Yala and attacks occurred in three southern provinces, prompting a border policy review and the placement of ten border provinces on alert with evacuation centres prepared for possible refugees. The Thai foreign minister travelled to Myanmar for talks with Min Aung Hlaing on border security, while Thailand challenged Myanmar over arsenic-tainted rivers affecting cross-border water. Thai forces deployed F‑16s to the Tak border as part of the response. The insurgency now includes disputes over water contamination alongside traditional violence. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPYko2TXRuRkZsdy04WmdzaW95MzJCTjdfVjFiS1llRGEzOHJCbWpXS1ZTcFJNeS1RVlNRN1RDd2F6OVdYeTVBaHNITWFJX3ZPRkdwVDhiV0tsOFk1eEk3ZkZUSFVnTTN5Tm9pa05qQWZuaUFuYWhGbW5PekxvRGxkUTJfT0VzTmU2Q2VZLVJtd2E3cXVrdml2WjdISkJtNWV5eXZDS2pQc1c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Dazzling Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOS2dxa3BjSXFxcktBbjFhbkZYNEVhMVdYMjFUeDZwSUNfZUluRDJpODlBem9OQU9QZVhIXzN1V3g3RVJoREVVSkg4b0RKSTg3ZTZ2TS1PWFlKQU9kNUgtN3hWa2d5NUE0R0xOVnJDV3VhM2ltRklMMkx5d3lpU1Bza0JnVXdxczVDNFdfRmFWcjR1RElpUTF5dm5DTm1FblYyMTdNdGRUTGJ6TVJUT3h1TTB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNT2t6UFZhUUZNQm9FMF9ZWVBhRVdHVDFNWVlQSjdoUHp6dGp5WWlWOHRTS2M2aU1MaFZWQVdwaUhaU2lMWUtLbFk4bWwwaXl2dDd0TnJ6UUctWGIwaDJab1l5d29WUnNKWjEyeEZhSVI1UFRoUFYxNVZ3RkdSQzlyV3E1bG1lVEtKbXFxVDBhcjl1VTQwcGFxdDBrTy1UbU5qOUhvQ05oeWQzaV9vUlRuUEhDYVZucW4zbkoyd3hXeUlsdDJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNYUlTaUt0Vjl1UWhYQzRiWmRZeEg0UFMxdnFjMXdWUjFmd2JLZE14aHJzUFJETnVoTERUQjVDalgxYkhwUi10SjI5Q1NwQT